From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 09:17:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): exempt key-matched chat reviews without creator
 cards [daveey]

Apply the operator-provided patch (SHA256
95cf0e82e897944bb7361aa6ad3e6051a5ea204875ee6871134928fd38a4e6aa).
The hub matches core-wt-review: keys, so key matching must not defeat
exempt review titles with no creator row. Named detectors still wait,
as do non-exempt titles and reviews of gate-held local creator cards.

Correct the preceding implementation's incorrect key-prefix exclusion
and replace its synthetic unresolved-row tests with the actual creation
boundary and the hub's review regex.

RED: production at origin/main 4990c8adab26, chat-ship-review fails;
detector-review and not-exempt-title pass. GREEN: all four lanes consumer
files pass (76 tests). Full scripts/check --base origin/main passes.

Implemented-by: gpt-6.1-sol (openai-codex)
---
 hermes_cli/kanban_lanes.py            |  7 +++--
 tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_lanes.py | 43 ++++++++++++++-------------
 2 files changed, 26 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hermes_cli/kanban_lanes.py b/hermes_cli/kanban_lanes.py
index a91fa319e5..210f560c15 100644
--- a/hermes_cli/kanban_lanes.py
+++ b/hermes_cli/kanban_lanes.py
@@ -340,11 +340,12 @@ def _gated(conn, pol: Policy, lane_name: str, opts: dict) -> bool:
         return False
     title = opts.get("title") or ""
     if any(p.search(title) for p in lane.gate_exempt):
-        # Review and land work of an admitted card must be able to finish it.
+        # Review and land work of an admitted card must be able to finish it. A chat's own ship files its review
+        # with no creator card (only a ``key_prefixes`` match makes it agent-filed): nothing upstream is held, so
+        # it finishes too. A named detector (``creators``) filing such a title still waits.
         row = _creator_row(conn, opts)
         if row is None:
-            # Chat-filed reviews have no local creator row; detectors still need admission.
-            if opts.get("created_by") not in lane.creators and not _key_matches(lane, key):
+            if opts.get("created_by") not in lane.creators:
                 return False
         elif not (row["status"] == "triage" and row["block_kind"] == GATE_KIND):
             return False
